    "detailed_description": "Normal Person is a single player horror/comedy story driven game<br />\r\nWill you be able to escape? Do you even want to escape? Will you be stuck in a limbo with the man who claims to be a &quot;Normal person&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is choice based and your choices and actions matter! Put together clues and look around you surrounding for anything that might help you escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMore details:<br />\r\nThe game is in first person and is mostly focused on your choices and dialogue<br />\r\nFully voiced <br />\r\nOriginal artwork<br />\r\nNarrative based<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is currently in early development!<br />\r\nNote: Steam wants me to write a lot about this game for it to be approved for the store but I don't want to give too much away and keep it as vague as possible!",
